[00:00] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'How do you create an indoor Gaussian splatting model with this level of detail and realistic colors? All you need is an Insta360 X5 and Mimap. To begin, plan your capture path. First, walk along the walls to capture'

[00:14] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the entire space. Then, record additional passes for detailed or occluded areas. Use 1 X5 for three passes at high, mid, and low heights, or'

[00:26] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'combine three cameras to capture all three heights in a single pass. Next, [music] import the INSV panoramic video into Mimap. Extract frames. Check image'

[00:38] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'overlap and sharpness. Choose the reconstruction quality and start automatic reconstruction. When it\'s finished, you can freely explore a photorealistic Gaussian splatting scene. Follow Mimap for more 3D reconstruction'

[00:53] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'tips.'
